MODULE: CoreStepRefinedDeleteMarksAppend
TARGET: CoreStepRefined
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the witness deletion also marks the WAL appended
PERTURBS: DeleteTree

--- FIND
    /\ ~deleted /\ deleted' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<leaf, free, cold, hold, head, appended, timely, admitted, leadDone, rank>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: deletion touches state the core deletion leaves alone.
    /\ ~deleted /\ deleted' = TRUE /\ appended' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<leaf, free, cold, hold, head, timely, admitted, leadDone, rank>>
--- END
